Notes: GRAM's NCEP base period is 1997-2015, the RRA El Paso base is 1990-95; the balloons are 1991-2020 and the tool is trained 1991-2020 with trend terms, so a warm 2024-25 shows up as a negative T mean error for every climatology. Balloon density ignores humidity (under 1 % near the ground). GRAM heights are taken as above sea level (the geoid offset there is about 25 m, under one model level near the ground).

